lemma CarvedT_R (X:U.RootS u)(L:finsJ): ∀ᶠ f:ℕ in atTop,∀ (x:P.VMark)(R:Signed× Bool)(p':f0 ≤ f),∃ w:FrameK (Fin (θ (ΤbandR u))),ΦCentered p B0 M x R (ΤbandR u) pu A (S x R _) D (V.go ..) p' w= AtMarkR p B0 M x pu A D m U S V R p' u true L X∧ RankQJ P.par f* LoomK w ≤ SpringR P f^(18+40*m):=by
